<title>UK: Metway Bank sets $100 mln one-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Metway Bank sets $100 mln one-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase Investment Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   METWAY BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST IBCA  A1	  ISS PRICE  99.97     FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
